{
  "id": "026",
  "title": "Back to Big Timber",
  "subtitle": "\"He left our small Montana town at nineteen. Five years later I moved back with our four-year-old daughter and he was the first person I saw.\"",
  "penName": "Tess Harrow",
  "genre": "secretPregnancy",
  "hook": "I left Big Timber, Montana at nineteen carrying two things: a bag of clothes and a secret I hadn't yet named. My daughter Poppy was born seven months later in Missoula, where I finished nursing school while my mother helped with nights. Five years later my mother died. I moved back to Big Timber with Poppy to settle the house. Wyatt Ash was the first person I saw. He was standing at the hardware store he now owned since his father died. He looked at Poppy. He looked at me. He said, \"Tess.\"",
